<!-- ============ OUR STORY (pattern band) ============ -->
<section class="story" id="mission" data-section="our-story">
  <div class="story__pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="story__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
    <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Keeping Unity, Love</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">And Respect in Society</span></span></h2>
    <p class="story__lede">Soccer has a way of bringing people together. It doesn't ask where you were born, how much money your family makes or what neighborhood you come from. When the ball rolls onto the field, we are all part of the same game.</p>
    <p class="story__body">But not every child gets the same opportunity to play it. Sometimes it's a pair of cleats. A uniform. A registration fee. Transportation to practice. Access to a field, a coach or a safe place to play. And sometimes, all a young athlete needs is for someone to <em>believe in them.</em></p>
    <ol class="acro" aria-label="KULARS: Keeping Unity, Love And Respect in Society">
      <li><b>K</b><span>Keeping</span></li>
      <li><b>U</b><span>Unity</span></li>
      <li><b>L</b><span>Love</span></li>
      <li><b>A</b><span>And</span></li>
      <li><b>R</b><span>Respect</span></li>
      <li><b>S</b><span>in Society</span></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="story__sign">You wear KULARS. Someone else gets a chance.</p>
    <a href="/pages/our-story" class="btn btn--light magnetic story__cta"><span>Read our story</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CUSTOM KITS ============ -->
<section class="cta" id="custom" data-section="contact-form">
  <div class="wrap cta__grid">
    <div class="cta__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Custom kits · Kit your club for 2027</p>
      <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Let's build</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">your kit.</span></span></h2>
      <p class="cta__copy">Tell us about your club and we'll come back with a range, samples and a price per player. Every kit we make sends 5% back to grassroots football.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>Brief</h3><p>Send your crest, colors and squad list.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Design &amp; samples</h3><p>We draw the range and send samples to try.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Production</h3><p>Names, numbers and crests, packed by player.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Club shop live</h3><p>Your supporters' shop goes online. We ship it.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <form class="kit-form" id="kitForm" novalidate>
      <div class="field"><input id="f-club" name="club" required placeholder=" " autocomplete="organization"><label for="f-club">Club name</label></div>
      <div class="field"><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder=" " autocomplete="email"><label for="f-email">Email</label></div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field"><select id="f-level" name="level"><option>Semi-pro / USL2</option><option>Academy</option><option>High school / College</option><option>Amateur / Sunday league</option></select><label for="f-level" class="is-fixed">Level</label></div>
        <div class="field"><input id="f-squad" name="squad" type="number" min="1" placeholder=" "><label for="f-squad">Squad size</label></div>
      </div>
      <fieldset class="chips">
        <legend>What do you need?</legend>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="f-need-training" checked><span>Training kit</span></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="f-need-travel"><span>Travel wear</span></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="f-need-bags"><span>Bags &amp; accessories</span></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="f-need-shop" checked><span>Club shop</span></label>
      </fieldset>
      <button class="btn btn--indigo btn--full magnetic" type="submit"><span>Send the brief</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      <p class="kit-form__msg" id="formMsg" role="status"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

